136
00:03:15,120 --> 00:03:16,560
Linda pays.

137
00:03:16,560 --> 00:03:17,840
One more thing.

138
00:03:17,840 --> 00:03:18,560
These are the

139
00:03:18,560 --> 00:03:20,440
2026 numbers.

140
00:03:20,440 --> 00:03:22,080
The 2027 lines come

141
00:03:22,080 --> 00:03:23,200
out in November,

142
00:03:23,200 --> 00:03:24,160
so check them before

143
00:03:24,160 --> 00:03:25,280
you plan.

144
00:03:25,280 --> 00:03:27,240
Tax brackets are buckets.

145
00:03:27,240 --> 00:03:29,120
IRMAA is a cliff.

146
00:03:29,120 --> 00:03:30,240
So before your next

147
00:03:30,240 --> 00:03:31,360
big withdrawal,

148
00:03:31,360 --> 00:03:33,120
